      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This prayer for the International Holocaust Remembrance Day was first offered by Rabbi Lior Bar-Ami sometime before May 2024. The prayer was written in English with English German accompanied by the Hebrew title, “תְּפִלָּה לְיּוֹם הַזִּכְרוֹן הַבֵּין-לְאֻמִּי לַשּׁוֹאָה“.</tei:p>
